Credits (facts and ideas only; no code from these projects is copied or linked)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* fishcu / oly_fw_analysis (https://github.com/fishcu/oly_fw_analysis, Apache-2.0): public documentation of the Olympus update container and
